# ==============================================================================
# FKST — Frontend Environment Variables (.env.example)
# ==============================================================================
#
# The frontend is a fully STATIC site (an Introduction page and a Get Started
# guide). It makes no backend or auth calls, so it needs NO environment
# configuration to build or run — `npm run dev` / `npm run build` work as-is.
#
# This template is kept as a placeholder for future, optional build-time flags.
#
# SECURITY: Never place secrets here. Any variable prefixed with VITE_ is
# embedded into the client bundle in plain text and is publicly visible.
